{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50208","headline":"送薛大入洛（伯三七七一下同） · 房元阳","name":"送薛大入洛（伯三七七一下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惊年嗟未极，别绪复相依。\n雁随春北度，人共水东归。\n夜月临轩尽，残灯入晓微。\n哀怨一罢曲，幽桂徒芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房元阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}